From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:30:00 +0200
Subject: ARM: dts: sun8i-h3-zeropi: drop the K1 power key

The ZeroPi has no K1 key. PL3 stays low, so gpio-keys reports a pressed
power key on resume. systemd-logind then powers the board off.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/allwinner/sun8i-h3-zeropi.dts | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/boot/dts/allwinner/sun8i-h3-zeropi.dts b/arch/arm/boot/dts/allwinner/sun8i-h3-zeropi.dts
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/allwinner/sun8i-h3-zeropi.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/allwinner/sun8i-h3-zeropi.dts
@@ -46,6 +46,8 @@ / {
 	model = "FriendlyARM ZeroPi";
 	compatible = "friendlyarm,zeropi", "allwinner,sun8i-h3";
 
+	/delete-node/ gpio-keys;
+
 	aliases {
 		ethernet0 = &emac;
 	};
-- 
Armbian

